Derivation
================================================================================

OmniSim is a derivative work of Webots, the open-source robot simulator
developed by Cyberbotics Ltd. (https://github.com/cyberbotics/webots),
released under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

    Copyright 1996-2024 Cyberbotics Ltd.

Substantial portions of the source tree under src/, projects/, resources/,
docs/, include/, lib/, and Contents/ originate from Webots. Files that
retain their original Cyberbotics copyright headers remain copyright of
Cyberbotics Ltd.; modifications to those files and all newly added files
in this distribution are copyright of OmniLink and contributors, and are
