NOTICE OF MODIFICATION (Apache License 2.0, Section 4(b))
---------------------------------------------------------
Files in this distribution that originate from Webots HAVE BEEN MODIFIED by
OmniLink. Modified files carry a modification notice in their header, of the
form:

    Modifications copyright 2026 OmniLink, licensed under the
    Apache License, Version 2.0.

Those per-file headers ARE the notice Section 4(b) requires, and they are the
record that travels with the artifact you received: every modified file states,
in the file itself, that it carries prominent notice of modification. Do not
look for a commit-by-commit changelog in a release: public releases are
published as a single squashed snapshot per version, so the release history is
per-version (see CHANGELOG.md), not per-change.

OmniSim is not a redistribution of Webots: it is a substantially modified
derivative work with different physics defaults, a different renderer path, a
different controller runtime, and large bodies of newly authored code that have
no upstream counterpart.

OmniSim is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Cyberbotics Ltd.
"Webots" and "Cyberbotics" are trademarks of Cyberbotics Ltd. The Apache
