Historical
----------
The Open Dynamics Engine (ODE), together with the libccd and OPCODE components
that were bundled inside it, WAS REMOVED from this distribution on 2026-08-08:
src/ode/ and include/ode/ were deleted, and Newton is now the only physics
backend. Nothing here links or ships ODE, libccd or OPCODE, and the paths that
carried their license texts no longer exist. Releases up to and including that
date did ship ODE under its BSD option; a redistributor holding one of those
releases should rely on the NOTICE file that accompanied it, not on this one.

